# DELIBERATELY NARROW. Do not add `* text=auto` here.
#
# dct-ios.html and sw.js are CRLF in the working tree by long-standing repo
# convention, and tools/hooks/phantom-guard.js actively checks that they stay
# that way — a blanket renormalisation would rewrite ~48k line endings in the
# app file and trip the very gate that exists to catch it.
#
# The one rule below exists because core.autocrlf is true on the build machine.
# Without it, a fresh clone checks tools/githooks/pre-commit out with CRLF and
# the shebang fails at runtime as: /bin/sh^M: bad interpreter. Shell scripts
# must be LF regardless of platform.
tools/githooks/* text eol=lf
